{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N8w2rjXity2wCbnCR3Wrba","type":"tool_result","content":"36\t- Persisted picker preferences should use configurable attributes and guard\n37\t  every `localStorage` read and write with an in-memory fallback.\n38\t- Picker interaction tests should query public roles such as `gridcell`,\n39\t  `radio`, and `status`, rather than component class names or private fields.\n40\t- The grid uses the ARIA grid pattern: `role=\"row\"` wrappers hold\n41\t  `role=\"gridcell\"` wrappers, each holding a native `<button>`. Query\n42\t  buttons inside gridcells with `[role=\"gridcell\"] button`, not\n43\t  `[role=\"gridcell\"]` alone.\n44\t- Roving tabindex: exactly one grid button has `tabindex=\"0\"`. Use\n45\t  `focusCell()` to update tabindex when moving focus by arrow key or click.\n46\t- Grid event listeners (hover, focus, click) are delegated from the grid\n47\t  container in `static render`, not per-cell in `renderGrid`. This avoids\n48\t  accumulating listeners across re-renders.\n49\t\n50\t## Picker dismissal and focus\n51\t\n52\t- The panel uses `popover=\"auto\"` (not `\"manual\"`) when not inline.\n53\t  Light dismiss and Escape are handled by the platform; no document\n54\t  click listener is needed.\n55\t- The `toggle` event on the panel keeps the `opened` flag in sync."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6da8e044-980b-454b-b3d1-29ae769542a1","uuid":"232fd9d9-3bbb-4856-8f3c-71e0a54f1b02","timestamp":"2026-09-23T19:05:37.156Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/emoji-input.correctness-audit-fixes-07-inline-display-mode/AGENTS.md","content":"- Persisted picker preferences should use configurable attributes and guard\n  every `localStorage` read and write with an in-memory fallback.\n- Picker interaction tests should query public roles such as `gridcell`,\n  `radio`, and `status`, rather than component class names or private fields.\n- The grid uses the ARIA grid pattern: `role=\"row\"` wrappers hold\n  `role=\"gridcell\"` wrappers, each holding a native `<button>`. Query\n  buttons inside gridcells with `[role=\"gridcell\"] button`, not\n  `[role=\"gridcell\"]` alone.\n- Roving tabindex: exactly one grid button has `tabindex=\"0\"`. Use\n  `focusCell()` to update tabindex when moving focus by arrow key or click.\n- Grid event listeners (hover, focus, click) are delegated from the grid\n  container in `static render`, not per-cell in `renderGrid`. This avoids\n  accumulating listeners across re-renders.\n\n## Picker dismissal and focus\n\n- The panel uses `popover=\"auto\"` (not `\"manual\"`) when not inline.\n  Light dismiss and Escape are handled by the platform; no document\n  click listener is needed.\n- The `toggle` event on the panel keeps the `opened` flag in sync.","numLines":20,"startLine":36,"totalLines":96}}}
