{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CfLtpUioq2QuT3eE1iymF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lint passes (only a deprecation warning from eslint config, not from our code).\n\nAll checklist items complete:\n\n- [x] An inline picker reports `isOpen` true immediately after connect without `open()` being called\n- [x] After a selection, an inline picker's panel is still visible and `isOpen` is still true\n- [x] Arrow keys move focus between grid cells in an inline picker that was never opened\n- [x] Escape in an inline picker clears the search query and leaves the panel visible\n- [x] `close()` on an inline picker leaves the panel visible\n- [x] Adding the `inline` attribute to a connected popover picker makes the panel visible; removing it hides the panel and `isOpen` becomes false\n\nSummary: Implemented inline display mode as a first-class mode for `<emoji-picker>`. The `inline` attribute makes the panel always visible with `isOpen` always true. `open()` only focuses search, `close()` is a no-op, selection keeps the panel visible, and Escape clears the query instead of closing. The attribute can be toggled at runtime via `syncMode()`. All 1301 tests pass, lint is clean."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":225,"cache_read_input_tokens":89714,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":225},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6da8e044-980b-454b-b3d1-29ae769542a1","uuid":"b5ebc31b-feb2-4e06-bbab-24899d89823f","timestamp":"2026-09-23T19:06:22.481Z","request_id":"req_011CfLtpUAaNCDcnGsinjZVh"}
